    - target: {fileID: 2127842040194719528, guid: aadb2b42a8950914787643598a4db751, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Air
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4844587605343904853, guid: aadb2b42a8950914787643598a4db751, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Air is a capricious element, constantly changing and always in motion. It can range from a gentle breeze to a powerful gale in moments and is capable of great feats of movement. It flows over the earth as its chaotic counterpart on the Axis of Matter, carrying dust yet parted by mountains. \r\n\r\nAir is the great accelerant, speeding the flow of mana. Left unchecked, it can break the shackles of the runes and move the mana of its own accord, creating paths where there should be none. As such, air must be guided carefully along the proper channels lest it blow away your diligent chains.\r\n\r\nThe Zodiac constellations commonly associated with Air are Gemini the Twins, Libra the Scales, and Aquarius the Water Bearer. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5422127031761078480, guid: aadb2b42a8950914787643598a4db751, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: The Element of Air
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
